      "surah_name": "Taa-Haa",
      "literal_gloss": "the Samiri",
      "translations": {
        "saheeh": "[Allah] said, \"But indeed, We have tried your people after you [departed], and the Samiri has led them astray.\"",
        "pickthall": "He said: Lo! We have tried thy folk in thine absence, and As-Samiri hath misled them.",
        "khattab": "Allah responded, “We have indeed tested your people in your absence, and the Sâmiri has led them astray.”",
        "arberry": "Said He, 'We have tempted thy people since thou didst leave them. The Samaritan has misled them into error.'"
      }
    },
    {
